  "notes": "Smoke-only OTA. Density selection now owns an atomic four-segment LED frame: every non-selected segment is forced off, mode handoff never overlays two segments, error cues use one exclusive segment, and the shared RMT mutex no longer sleeps while blocking the other strip. Start validation measures the cartridge passively on the already-selected 10/30/60/210 PWM instead of producing a fixed 192/255 smoke pulse, preserving the established pump and burst/pause behavior. Missing-cartridge and low-current faults keep Start blocked until a low-energy pump-off probe confirms physical reinsertion. Twin Button firmware content remains unchanged.",
